This repository does not vendor third-party meshes. It contains one port of
third-party source code:

- src/bipedlab/sim/bam_xl330.py is derived from Rhoban/bam
  (https://github.com/Rhoban/bam, commit 62bd8ce12154340be97e06f7f41a0ca8f116d967),
  Copyright 2025 Marc Duclusaud & Grégoire Passault, licensed under the
  Apache License, Version 2.0. Equations and the XL330 M6 parameters were
  re-implemented from that source (see docs/decisions/ADR-0010-bam-actuator-port.md).
 Pinned
upstream projects are fetched into third_party/ at build/test time
(see upstream.lock.toml) and keep their own licenses:

- pollen-robotics/microduck      Apache-2.0
- pollen-robotics/microduck_rl   Apache-2.0 (code, MJCF); STL meshes CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
- jonathanhawkins/microduck-lab  see docs/research/microduck-lab.md

Microduck is a robot by Pollen Robotics (https://pollen-robotics.com/microduck).
